  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aims at building a knowledge base in Uganda on how LGBT people are organizing themselves, are treated by the health service, the police and other authorities and described/represented in the media. The overall aim is to contribute to public opinion based on facts rather than perceptions in these very sensitive and controversial issues.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftar till bygga upp en kunskapsbas i Uganda om bl a hur hbt-personer organiserar sig, bem&#xF6;ts av h&#xE4;lsov&#xE5;rden , polis och andra myndigheter samt beskrivs/representeras i media . Det &#xF6;vergripande syftet &#xE4;r att bidra till opinionsbildning som utg&#xE5;r fr&#xE5;n fakta snarare &#xE4;n uppfattningar i dessa mycket k&#xE4;nsliga och kontroversiella fr&#xE5;gor.</narrative>
  </description>
